# Keep LF line endings on every platform: configs and scripts are read by Linux
# containers and shells, also when the repository is cloned on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
# Documents are binary even when they happen to look like text (a small PDF can be
# plain ASCII); line ending changes would corrupt them.
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
*.odt binary
*.zip binary
